{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Lots.</b> For the lot in particular, through His devout one, is as when a man inquires of the matter of Elohim, as it says: בַּחֵיק יוּטַל אֶת הַגּוֹרָל, וּמֵה׳ כָּל מִשְׁפָּטוֹ — 'The lot is cast into the lap, but the whole decision is from HaShem' (Proverbs 16:33)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:36:28.406756899Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}